# Tooling-generated codebase summaries. Ignored rather than committed because
# they are regenerated from the tree and would go stale silently — and because
# an untracked file makes the tree dirty, which makes the release script refuse
# to stamp a build. That refusal is correct and cost a near-miss to discover:
# the script's message was hidden behind a grep filter, so a stale binary was
# signed and staged before a version check caught it.
ARCHITECTURE.md
STRUCTURE.md
